    "prompt": "Use case: photorealistic-natural. Asset type: RiverKing fishing-game location background, wide 16:9 landscape, 1792x1024 or closest supported landscape. Primary request: a geographically grounded scenic view of the real Rio Paraguai beside Serra do Amolar, Pantanal, Mato Grosso do Sul, Brazil, seen by an angler from a low natural bank. Recognizable landscape: an isolated rugged ridge of ancient dark rock, green wooded slopes with exposed reddish-brown rock shoulders, rising abruptly above an otherwise flat immense floodplain, not Andean or alpine mountains. The ridge is across the far bank in the central and right upper third; a lower distant ridge recedes left. A broad slow muddy olive-brown Paraguay River occupies the lower 60 percent, subtle realistic small ripples, gently reflecting the ridge. Narrow gallery forest at water level, floodplain grasses at the outer edges, only a small patch of muddy grass bank at the bottom-left corner. Natural early-morning light, blue sky, soft scattered warm clouds, restrained golden side light, clear visibility and plausible Brazilian Pantanal vegetation. Realistic detailed photographic game environment, no fantasy scenery. Composition must remain useful on narrow mobile crops: distinctive ridge in central upper area, center water fully unobstructed, horizon around 38 percent from top. Contiguous open castable water x=16%-88%, y=48%-80%. No people, boats, houses, landmarks from other regions, fishing rods, bobbers, visible fish, text, UI, logos or watermarks. This is a new image based on the actual topography, not an edit of the earlier generic river."
